OL,3,GNEWSACar park fees in five town centres
OL,4,Ato be scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusinesses have welcomed the scrapping
OL,7,Fof parking charges in a number of town
OL,8,Fcentre car parks in Leeds.
OL,10,FThe charges - of up to #3.65 a day -
OL,11,Fwere introduced in Wetherby, Horsforth,
OL,12,FGarforth, Rothwell and Guiseley last
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FJames Gibson, Labour's executive member
OL,16,Ffor environment at Leeds City Council,
OL,17,Fsaid the charges would be abolished
OL,18,Fwith effect from 9 November after a
OL,19,Fpublic consultation.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
