OL,3,GNEWSACar park fees in five town centres
OL,4,Ato be scrapped
OL,5,
OL,6,FPenelope, who manages a hair salon in
OL,7,FWetherby, said it would make a "big
OL,8,Fdifference" to her staff who have to
OL,9,Fpay for parking during their working
OL,10,Fhours.
